item.tt2.scout_boots.name=Scout Boots
item.tt2.scout_helmet.desc=Light armor built for scouting, skirmishing, and evasive movement. It provides only half the armor of standard Tinkers' armor and no toughness, but uses material toughness to increase ranged damage and uses armor value to give the wearer a matching chance to dodge enemy attacks.\nIt improves fall damage reduction and environmental damage reduction, while also making enemies less likely to focus you when other valid targets are nearby.\nSet bonuses improve as more pieces are worn, further enhancing jump and movement capabilities.
item.tt2.scout_chestplate.desc=Light armor built for scouting, skirmishing, and evasive movement. It provides only half the armor of standard Tinkers' armor and no toughness, but uses material toughness to increase ranged damage and uses armor value to give the wearer a matching chance to dodge enemy attacks.\nIt improves fall damage reduction and environmental damage reduction, while also making enemies less likely to focus you when other valid targets are nearby.\nSet bonuses improve as more pieces are worn, further enhancing jump and movement capabilities.
item.tt2.scout_leggings.desc=Light armor built for scouting, skirmishing, and evasive movement. It provides only half the armor of standard Tinkers' armor and no toughness, but uses material toughness to increase ranged damage and uses armor value to give the wearer a matching chance to dodge enemy attacks.\nIt improves fall damage reduction and environmental damage reduction, while also making enemies less likely to focus you when other valid targets are nearby.\nSet bonuses improve as more pieces are worn, further enhancing jump and movement capabilities.
item.tt2.scout_boots.desc=Light armor built for scouting, skirmishing, and evasive movement. It provides only half the armor of standard Tinkers' armor and no toughness, but uses material toughness to increase ranged damage and uses armor value to give the wearer a matching chance to dodge enemy attacks.\nIt improves fall damage reduction and environmental damage reduction, while also making enemies less likely to focus you when other valid targets are nearby.\nSet bonuses improve as more pieces are worn, further enhancing jump and movement capabilities.

