# Combo trait
modifier.nunchaku_combo.name=Combo
modifier.nunchaku_combo.desc=Hm hm ha hey!\nHitting enemies builds combo stacks to boost damage. Cap depends on binding material; resets after inactivity.
tt2.trait.nunchaku_combo=Combo %s/%s  (+%s%%)  Damage x%s
modifier.tt2_lunge.name=Lunge
modifier.tt2_craftsman_farming.name=Farming
modifier.tt2_craftsman_farming.desc=You reap what you sow§r\nAllows your staff to till soil like a hoe
modifier.tt2_craftsman_combat.name=Combat
modifier.tt2_craftsman_combat.desc=This is the finest sword in the village, even if it isn't a sword§r\nIncreases your staff's offensive power and attack reach, and also raises its attack speed
modifier.tt2_craftsman_mining.name=Mining
modifier.tt2_craftsman_mining.desc=Mine should always come before craft!§r\nAllows your staff to mine blocks like a pickaxe
modifier.tt2_craftsman_excavation.name=Excavation
modifier.tt2_craftsman_excavation.desc=Should it bury the departed, or clear a path?§r\nAllows your staff to mine blocks like a shovel and create paths.\nIf Farming is also applied, you must sneak to create paths.
modifier.tt2_craftsman_felling.name=Felling
modifier.tt2_craftsman_felling.desc=I really hope that evergreen doesn't suddenly stand up and hit me§r\nAllows your staff to chop like an axe and increases its offensive power, but lowers its attack speed
modifier.tt2_craftsman_shearing.name=Shearing
modifier.tt2_craftsman_shearing.desc=It can cut anything except magically golden hair§r\nGrants your staff the tool capabilities of shears
modifier.tt2_craftsman_nature.name=Nature
modifier.tt2_craftsman_nature.desc=Growth, life, happiness... and friends§r\nGrants the functions of the Wand of the Forest and Mana Blaster, with a built-in Damage Lens
modifier.tt2_craftsman_insight.name=Insight
modifier.tt2_craftsman_insight.desc=Knowledge itself is power§r\nGrants your staff the functions of a Caster's Gauntlet. When no casting focus is installed, your Tinker's Staff also gains the transmutation effect of Salis Mundus.
modifier.tt2_craftsman_research.name=Research
modifier.tt2_craftsman_research.desc=A tinker is only as good as their tools§r\nGrants wrench functions from currently supported technology mods
modifier.tt2_craftsman_forestry.name=Forestry
modifier.tt2_craftsman_forestry.desc=A beekeeper's must-have at home or on the road§r\nGrants the functions of the scoop, smoker, grafter, and portable analyzer; sneak-right-click to open the analyzer
