modifier.tt2_lunge.desc=§oOne-on-one! You and me!! Right now!!!§r\nSpear stabs consume hunger to propel you forward, even if no target is hit. Lunge does not activate while mounted, in water, flying with an Elytra, or when your hunger is too low.

